        "id": "p4-q4-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "I own 32 copies of the 4 cent postage stamp issued by Jaga Jaga Island in 1930, and this is 20% of the total number of these stamps in existence. How many more of these stamps must I buy in order to own 25% of the total?",
